      "headline": "Fuel Relief Scheme Pakistan: Rs100/Litre Petrol Subsidy Explained (2026)",
      "description": "The Fuel Relief Scheme is checked and registered via SMS to 9771 — a Rs100/litre petrol subsidy for motorcycles, three-wheelers, and cars up to 800cc, run by the Petroleum Division.",
